# Build context hygiene: keep the image builds fast and prevent local
# artefacts (including the local .env with development credentials) from being
# sent to the Docker daemon or baked into an image.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

docs
*.md
